#. short #1
msgid "A Taiwan e-commerce toolkit for WooCommerce. Bundles Taiwanese payment, shipping and e-invoice integrations."
msgstr "為 WooCommerce 打造的台灣電商工具包，整合台灣本地的金流、物流與電子發票服務。"

#. section #2
msgid "Description"
msgstr "說明"

#. block #3
msgid "A Taiwan-focused WooCommerce extension. Toggleable modules cover ECPay (綠界), NewebPay (藍新), SmilePay (速買配), LINE Pay, PAYUNi (統一金流), PayNow (立吉富), PChomePay (支付連), TapPay and Shopline Payments for payments; ECPay, NewebPay, SmilePay, PAYUNi and PayNow for convenience-store + home-delivery shipping; ezPay, ECPay, SmilePay, PayNow and AMEGO for Taiwan e-invoicing."
msgstr "專為台灣市場打造的 WooCommerce 擴充套件。可自由開關的模組涵蓋：金流有綠界 (ECPay)、藍新 (NewebPay)、速買配 (SmilePay)、LINE Pay、統一金流 (PAYUNi)、立吉富 (PayNow)、支付連 (PChomePay)、TapPay 與 Shopline Payments；超商取貨與宅配物流有綠界、藍新、速買配、統一金流與立吉富；台灣電子發票有 ezPay、綠界、速買配、立吉富與光貿 (AMEGO)。"

#. block #4
msgid "Enable only the providers you need from a single settings page — payment, shipping and invoice modules are fully independent and can be mixed in any combination."
msgstr "在同一個設定頁面只啟用你需要的服務商即可 —— 金流、物流與發票模組彼此完全獨立，可以任意搭配組合。"

#. block #5
msgid "HPOS-native, Block Checkout-native, PHP 8.2+ strict-typed, GPLv3, no premium gating."
msgstr "原生支援 HPOS 與區塊結帳，PHP 8.2+ 嚴格型別，採用 GPLv3 授權，沒有付費版限制。"

#. sub #6
msgid "Moksa AI assistant (new in 1.3.0)"
msgstr "Moksa AI 助手（1.3.0 新增）"

#. block #7
msgid "Built on the WordPress 7.0 AI Client, Moksa AI is an optional in-admin chat assistant that lets you run common store tasks in natural language: find orders by invoice / shipping / payment number, look up order details and counts, change order status (single or batch), add order notes, issue / void / allowance e-invoices, create and print shipping labels, and enable or disable modules, individual payment methods and invoice issuing methods. Every action that changes data first shows a summary and waits for your explicit confirmation before it runs. The assistant uses whichever AI provider you connect under Settings → Connectors — the plugin never handles your AI keys, refunds, or credentials."
msgstr "Moksa AI 建構在 WordPress 7.0 AI Client 之上，是一個選用的後台對話助手，讓你用自然語言完成常見的商店作業：用發票號碼／物流單號／金流交易序號找訂單、查詢訂單明細與各狀態筆數、變更訂單狀態（單筆或批次）、新增訂單備註、開立／作廢／折讓電子發票、建立與列印物流標籤，以及啟用或停用模組、個別付款方式與發票開立方式。任何會變更資料的動作都會先顯示摘要，等你明確確認後才執行。助手使用你在「設定 → 連接器」連上的 AI 服務商 —— 這個外掛不會經手你的 AI 金鑰、退款或任何憑證。"

#. sub #8
msgid "Source"
msgstr "原始碼"

#. block #9
msgid "Source code and issue tracker: [github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-for-woocommerce](https://github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-for-woocommerce)."
msgstr "原始碼與問題回報：[github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-for-woocommerce](https://github.com/Moksa1123/moksa-for-woocommerce)。"

#. section #10
msgid "External Services"
msgstr "外部服務"

#. block #11
msgid "This plugin is a toolkit of optional integrations. Each integration only loads and only transmits data when you, the site administrator, explicitly enable that module and a customer chooses the corresponding payment / shipping / invoice option. No data is sent to any third party unless the relevant module is enabled and used. The plugin never sends data to Moksa or any analytics/telemetry service."
msgstr "這個外掛是一組選用整合的工具包。每一項整合都只有在你（網站管理員）明確啟用該模組、而且顧客選擇了對應的付款／物流／發票選項時，才會載入並傳送資料。只要相關模組沒有啟用並實際使用，就不會有任何資料送往第三方。這個外掛不會傳送任何資料給 Moksa，也不會傳送給任何分析或遙測服務。"

#. block #12
msgid "For every integration below, requests are made server-to-server over HTTPS using your own merchant credentials, and typically include the order number, order amount, buyer name, e-mail, phone, shipping/billing address, item descriptions, and (for e-invoices) the buyer tax ID or carrier number that the customer enters at checkout."
msgstr "以下所有整合都是以你自己的商店憑證，透過 HTTPS 進行伺服器對伺服器的請求，內容通常包含訂單編號、訂單金額、買家姓名、電子郵件、電話、收件／帳單地址、商品說明，以及（電子發票的情況）顧客在結帳時填寫的買家統一編號或載具號碼。"

#. block #13
msgid "When a module is set to test/sandbox mode, requests go to the provider's corresponding staging hostname instead of the production one listed below (for example payment-stage.ecpay.com.tw, logistics-stage.ecpay.com.tw, einvoice-stage.ecpay.com.tw, ccore.newebpay.com, sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw, sandbox-api.pchomepay.com.tw, sandbox-api-pay.line.me, sandbox.tappaysdk.com, api-sandbox.shoplinepayments.com, cinv.ezpay.com.tw, test.paynow.com.tw, testinvoice.paynow.com.tw, ssl.smse.com.tw/api_test)."
msgstr "當模組切換到測試／沙箱模式時，請求會改送到該服務商對應的測試主機，而不是下方列出的正式主機（例如 payment-stage.ecpay.com.tw、logistics-stage.ecpay.com.tw、einvoice-stage.ecpay.com.tw、ccore.newebpay.com、sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw、sandbox-api.pchomepay.com.tw、sandbox-api-pay.line.me、sandbox.tappaysdk.com、api-sandbox.shoplinepayments.com、cinv.ezpay.com.tw、test.paynow.com.tw、testinvoice.paynow.com.tw、ssl.smse.com.tw/api_test）。"

#. sub #14
msgid "Payment gateways"
msgstr "金流服務"

#. block #15
msgid "These run when a customer selects the gateway at checkout (to create the payment) and when you query, capture, refund or void the payment from the order screen."
msgstr "這些請求會在顧客於結帳時選擇該付款方式（建立交易）時發生，以及你在訂單頁查詢、請款、退款或取消交易時發生。"

#. li #16
msgid "**ECPay (綠界科技)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, barcode, installments, wallets. Endpoints: payment.ecpay.com.tw, ecpayment.ecpay.com.tw (test mode: payment-stage.ecpay.com.tw, ecpayment-stage.ecpay.com.tw). Terms: https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ — Privacy: https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"
msgstr "**綠界科技 (ECPay)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、超商條碼、分期、電子錢包。連線位址：payment.ecpay.com.tw、ecpayment.ecpay.com.tw（測試模式：payment-stage.ecpay.com.tw、ecpayment-stage.ecpay.com.tw）。服務條款：https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ —— 隱私權政策：https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"

#. li #17
msgid "**NewebPay (藍新金流)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, barcode, wallets. Endpoints: core.newebpay.com (test mode: ccore.newebpay.com). Terms: https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/new_service_policy — Privacy: https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/privacy"
msgstr "**藍新金流 (NewebPay)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、超商條碼、電子錢包。連線位址：core.newebpay.com（測試模式：ccore.newebpay.com）。服務條款：https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/new_service_policy —— 隱私權政策：https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/privacy"

#. li #18
msgid "**PAYUNi (統一金流)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, wallets. Endpoints: api.payuni.com.tw (test mode: sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw). Terms: https://www.payuni.com.tw/terms — Privacy: https://www.payuni.com.tw/privacy"
msgstr "**統一金流 (PAYUNi)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、電子錢包。連線位址：api.payuni.com.tw（測試模式：sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.payuni.com.tw/terms —— 隱私權政策：https://www.payuni.com.tw/privacy"

#. li #19
msgid "**SmilePay (速買配)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, barcode. Endpoints: ssl.smse.com.tw (SmilePay's own API hostname — smse.com.tw and smilepay.net are both operated by the same company, 訊航科技 Shinhang Technology; its policies are published on the smilepay.net brand site; test mode uses the /api_test path on the same hostname). Terms: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp — Privacy: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp (SmilePay publishes a single combined service & personal-data-protection document, so both links point at that document)"
msgstr "**速買配 (SmilePay)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、超商條碼。連線位址：ssl.smse.com.tw（這是速買配自己的 API 主機名稱 —— smse.com.tw 與 smilepay.net 都由同一家公司訊航科技營運，政策文件發佈在 smilepay.net 品牌網站上；測試模式使用同一主機下的 /api_test 路徑）。服務條款：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp —— 隱私權政策：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp （速買配把服務條款與個資保護寫成單一份合併文件，因此兩個連結指向同一份）"

#. li #20
msgid "**PayNow (立吉富)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, installments. Endpoints: www.paynow.com.tw (test mode: test.paynow.com.tw). Terms: https://www.paynow.com.tw/PayNowUserAgreement.aspx — Privacy: https://www.paynow.com.tw/safepolicy.aspx"
msgstr "**立吉富 (PayNow)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、分期。連線位址：www.paynow.com.tw（測試模式：test.paynow.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.paynow.com.tw/PayNowUserAgreement.aspx —— 隱私權政策：https://www.paynow.com.tw/safepolicy.aspx"

#. li #21
msgid "**PChomePay (支付連)** — credit card, ATM, CVS, barcode. Endpoints: api.pchomepay.com.tw (test mode: sandbox-api.pchomepay.com.tw). Terms: https://www.pchomepay.com.tw/other/service_treaty — Privacy: https://web.pchomepay.com.tw/introduction/privacy"
msgstr "**支付連 (PChomePay)** —— 信用卡、ATM、超商代碼、超商條碼。連線位址：api.pchomepay.com.tw（測試模式：sandbox-api.pchomepay.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.pchomepay.com.tw/other/service_treaty —— 隱私權政策：https://web.pchomepay.com.tw/introduction/privacy"

#. li #22
msgid "**LINE Pay** — LINE Pay wallet. Endpoints: api-pay.line.me (test mode: sandbox-api-pay.line.me). Terms: https://terms2.line.me/linepay_TW_TermsofUse?lang=zh-Hant — Privacy: https://terms2.line.me/linepay_TW_PP"
msgstr "**LINE Pay** —— LINE Pay 電子錢包。連線位址：api-pay.line.me（測試模式：sandbox-api-pay.line.me）。服務條款：https://terms2.line.me/linepay_TW_TermsofUse?lang=zh-Hant —— 隱私權政策：https://terms2.line.me/linepay_TW_PP"

#. li #23
msgid "**TapPay** — credit card via the TapPay Fields SDK loaded in the browser (js.tappaysdk.com). Card data is tokenised client-side; only the token reaches your server. Endpoints: prod.tappaysdk.com, js.tappaysdk.com (test mode: sandbox.tappaysdk.com). Terms: https://www.tappaysdk.com/taiwan-en/privacy-term — Privacy: https://www.tappaysdk.com/taiwan-en/privacy-term (TapPay publishes a single combined terms & privacy document, so both links point at that document)"
msgstr "**TapPay** —— 信用卡，透過瀏覽器載入的 TapPay Fields SDK（js.tappaysdk.com）處理。卡片資料在前端就轉成 token，只有 token 會進到你的伺服器。連線位址：prod.tappaysdk.com、js.tappaysdk.com（測試模式：sandbox.tappaysdk.com）。服務條款：https://www.tappaysdk.com/taiwan-en/privacy-term —— 隱私權政策：https://www.tappaysdk.com/taiwan-en/privacy-term （TapPay 把服務條款與隱私權政策寫成單一份合併文件，因此兩個連結指向同一份）"

#. li #24
msgid "**Shopline Payments** — credit card, wallets. Endpoints: api.shoplinepayments.com (test mode: api-sandbox.shoplinepayments.com). Terms: https://book.shoplineapp.com/pages/shopline-payments-terms-and-conditions — Privacy: https://www.shopline.com/shopline-payments-privacy"
msgstr "**Shopline Payments** —— 信用卡、電子錢包。連線位址：api.shoplinepayments.com（測試模式：api-sandbox.shoplinepayments.com）。服務條款：https://book.shoplineapp.com/pages/shopline-payments-terms-and-conditions —— 隱私權政策：https://www.shopline.com/shopline-payments-privacy"

#. sub #25
msgid "Shipping / logistics"
msgstr "物流／貨運"

#. block #26
msgid "These run when a customer opens the convenience-store map at checkout (the store-selection map is hosted by the provider), when a shipment is created after an order is placed, and when you print a label or query shipment status."
msgstr "這些請求會在顧客於結帳時開啟超商門市地圖（門市選擇地圖由服務商自行代管）、訂單成立後建立物流訂單，以及你列印標籤或查詢物流狀態時發生。"

#. li #27
msgid "**ECPay Logistics (綠界物流)** — 7-11 / FamilyMart / Hi-Life / OK / home delivery. Endpoints: logistics.ecpay.com.tw (test mode: logistics-stage.ecpay.com.tw). Terms: https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ — Privacy: https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"
msgstr "**綠界物流 (ECPay Logistics)** —— 7-11／全家／萊爾富／OK／宅配。連線位址：logistics.ecpay.com.tw（測試模式：logistics-stage.ecpay.com.tw）。服務條款：https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ —— 隱私權政策：https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"

#. li #28
msgid "**NewebPay Logistics (藍新物流)** — CVS / home delivery. Endpoints: core.newebpay.com (test mode: ccore.newebpay.com). Terms: https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/new_service_policy — Privacy: https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/privacy"
msgstr "**藍新物流 (NewebPay Logistics)** —— 超商取貨／宅配。連線位址：core.newebpay.com（測試模式：ccore.newebpay.com）。服務條款：https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/new_service_policy —— 隱私權政策：https://www.newebpay.com/website/Page/content/privacy"

#. li #29
msgid "**PAYUNi Logistics (統一物流)** — 7-11 / home delivery (incl. cold chain). Endpoints: api.payuni.com.tw (test mode: sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw). Terms: https://www.payuni.com.tw/terms — Privacy: https://www.payuni.com.tw/privacy"
msgstr "**統一物流 (PAYUNi Logistics)** —— 7-11／宅配（含冷鏈）。連線位址：api.payuni.com.tw（測試模式：sandbox-api.payuni.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.payuni.com.tw/terms —— 隱私權政策：https://www.payuni.com.tw/privacy"

#. li #30
msgid "**SmilePay Logistics (速買配物流)** — 7-11 / FamilyMart / home delivery. Endpoints: ssl.smse.com.tw (SmilePay's own API hostname; see the SmilePay entry above — same operator as smilepay.net; test mode uses the /api_test path on the same hostname). Terms: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp — Privacy: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp (single combined service & personal-data-protection document)"
msgstr "**速買配物流 (SmilePay Logistics)** —— 7-11／全家／宅配。連線位址：ssl.smse.com.tw（速買配自己的 API 主機名稱；詳見上方速買配條目 —— 與 smilepay.net 為同一家營運商；測試模式使用同一主機下的 /api_test 路徑）。服務條款：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp —— 隱私權政策：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp （服務條款與個資保護合併為單一份文件）"

#. sub #31
msgid "E-invoice (Taiwan electronic invoicing)"
msgstr "電子發票（台灣電子發票）"

#. block #32
msgid "These run when an invoice is issued for an order (immediately on payment, on completion, or manually, per your setting) and when you void / issue an allowance / query an invoice. Data includes the order amount, item descriptions and the buyer's carrier number, donation code or company tax ID entered at checkout."
msgstr "這些請求會在為訂單開立發票時（依你的設定，可能是付款當下、訂單完成時或手動開立），以及你作廢發票／開立折讓／查詢發票時發生。傳送的資料包含訂單金額、商品說明，以及買家在結帳時填寫的載具號碼、愛心碼或公司統一編號。"

#. li #33
msgid "**ECPay e-Invoice (綠界電子發票)** — Endpoints: einvoice.ecpay.com.tw (test mode: einvoice-stage.ecpay.com.tw). Terms: https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ — Privacy: https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"
msgstr "**綠界電子發票 (ECPay e-Invoice)** —— 連線位址：einvoice.ecpay.com.tw（測試模式：einvoice-stage.ecpay.com.tw）。服務條款：https://support.ecpay.com.tw/10075/ —— 隱私權政策：https://www.ecpay.com.tw/CreditCard/Privacy"

#. li #34
msgid "**ezPay e-Invoice (ezPay 電子發票)** — Endpoints: inv.ezpay.com.tw (test mode: cinv.ezpay.com.tw). Terms: https://www.ezpay.com.tw/info/Site_description/service_page/member — Privacy: https://www.ezpay.com.tw/info/Site_description/service_page/member (ezPay publishes a single combined membership & data-protection terms page, so both links point at that page)"
msgstr "**ezPay 電子發票** —— 連線位址：inv.ezpay.com.tw（測試模式：cinv.ezpay.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.ezpay.com.tw/info/Site_description/service_page/member —— 隱私權政策：https://www.ezpay.com.tw/info/Site_description/service_page/member （ezPay 把會員條款與個資保護寫在同一個頁面，因此兩個連結指向同一頁）"

#. li #35
msgid "**SmilePay e-Invoice (速買配電子發票)** — Endpoints: ssl.smse.com.tw (SmilePay's own API hostname; see the SmilePay entry above — same operator as smilepay.net; test mode uses the /api_test path on the same hostname). Terms: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp — Privacy: https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp (single combined service & personal-data-protection document)"
msgstr "**速買配電子發票 (SmilePay e-Invoice)** —— 連線位址：ssl.smse.com.tw（速買配自己的 API 主機名稱；詳見上方速買配條目 —— 與 smilepay.net 為同一家營運商；測試模式使用同一主機下的 /api_test 路徑）。服務條款：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp —— 隱私權政策：https://www.smilepay.net/em/servicepolicy.asp （服務條款與個資保護合併為單一份文件）"

#. li #36
msgid "**PayNow e-Invoice (立吉富電子發票)** — Endpoints: invoice.paynow.com.tw (test mode: testinvoice.paynow.com.tw). Terms: https://www.paynow.com.tw/PayNowUserAgreement.aspx — Privacy: https://www.paynow.com.tw/safepolicy.aspx"
msgstr "**立吉富電子發票 (PayNow e-Invoice)** —— 連線位址：invoice.paynow.com.tw（測試模式：testinvoice.paynow.com.tw）。服務條款：https://www.paynow.com.tw/PayNowUserAgreement.aspx —— 隱私權政策：https://www.paynow.com.tw/safepolicy.aspx"

#. li #37
msgid "**AMEGO e-Invoice (光貿電子發票)** — Endpoints: invoice-api.amego.tw. Terms: https://invoice.amego.tw/term — Privacy: https://invoice.amego.tw/privacy"
msgstr "**光貿電子發票 (AMEGO e-Invoice)** —— 連線位址：invoice-api.amego.tw。服務條款：https://invoice.amego.tw/term —— 隱私權政策：https://invoice.amego.tw/privacy"

#. sub #38
msgid "Carrier tracking links (hyperlinks only — the plugin itself never contacts these hosts)"
msgstr "貨態查詢連結（純超連結 —— 外掛本身從不連線這些主機）"

#. block #39
msgid "When a shipment has a tracking number, the order screen renders a plain hyperlink to the carrier's own public parcel-tracking page. The plugin makes no HTTP request to any of these hosts and transmits no data to them; the shipment number only leaves your site if a person clicks the link, at which point the carrier's own terms and privacy policy apply in their browser:"
msgstr "當物流單有貨號時，訂單頁面會顯示一個純粹的超連結，指向該物流業者自己的公開貨態查詢頁。外掛不會對這些主機發出任何 HTTP 請求，也不會傳送任何資料給它們；貨號只有在有人點擊該連結時才會離開你的網站，屆時適用的是該業者在瀏覽器端自己的服務條款與隱私權政策："

#. li #40
msgid "**T-Cat 黑貓宅配** (t-cat.com.tw, incl. the tracking link shown for PAYUNi home-delivery shipments) — Privacy: https://www.t-cat.com.tw/member/privacy.aspx"
msgstr "**黑貓宅配 T-Cat**（t-cat.com.tw，包含統一金流宅配物流所顯示的貨態查詢連結）—— 隱私權政策：https://www.t-cat.com.tw/member/privacy.aspx"

#. li #41
msgid "**7-ELEVEN** (eservice.7-11.com.tw) — Privacy: https://www.7-11.com.tw/privacy.asp"
msgstr "**7-ELEVEN**（eservice.7-11.com.tw）—— 隱私權政策：https://www.7-11.com.tw/privacy.asp"

#. li #42
msgid "**7-ELEVEN pickup status via PAYUNi logistics** (tracking.shopmore.com.tw, operated by the Uni-President group for PAYUNi shipments) — service info: https://help.shopmore.com.tw/ ; the PAYUNi logistics policies above apply to the shipment itself"
msgstr "**透過統一金流物流查詢 7-ELEVEN 取貨狀態**（tracking.shopmore.com.tw，由統一集團為統一金流物流營運）—— 服務說明：https://help.shopmore.com.tw/ ；物流本身則適用上方統一物流的政策"

#. li #43
msgid "**FamilyMart 全家** (fmec.famiport.com.tw), **Hi-Life 萊爾富** (www.hilife.com.tw), **OK Mart** (ecservice.okmart.com.tw) — public tracking pages of each chain; their site policies are linked from those pages"
msgstr "**全家 FamilyMart**（fmec.famiport.com.tw）、**萊爾富 Hi-Life**（www.hilife.com.tw）、**OK Mart**（ecservice.okmart.com.tw）—— 各超商自己的公開貨態查詢頁；其網站政策皆從該頁面連出"

#. li #44
msgid "**Chunghwa Post 中華郵政** (postserv.post.gov.tw) — Privacy: https://www.post.gov.tw/post/internet/Group/index.jsp?ID=156739569921"
msgstr "**中華郵政 Chunghwa Post**（postserv.post.gov.tw）—— 隱私權政策：https://www.post.gov.tw/post/internet/Group/index.jsp?ID=156739569921"

#. sub #45
msgid "Moksa AI assistant (optional, admin-only)"
msgstr "Moksa AI 助手（選用，僅限管理員）"

#. block #46
msgid "When an administrator actively uses the in-admin Moksa AI assistant, the typed question and the store/order data needed to answer it (for example an order number, status, totals or invoice/shipping numbers) are sent to the AI provider you have connected in WordPress under **Settings → Connectors** — Anthropic, Google or OpenAI — through the WordPress 7.0 AI Client. This never happens automatically and only for the administrator using the assistant. The plugin does not store these conversations on any Moksa server, sends nothing to Moksa, and never transmits your AI provider keys (WordPress manages the connector credentials). The transmitted data is governed by the terms and privacy policy of the provider you choose: Anthropic — Terms: https://www.anthropic.com/legal/commercial-terms — Privacy: https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy ; Google — Terms: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms — Privacy: https://policies.google.com/privacy ; OpenAI — Terms: https://openai.com/policies/terms-of-use/ — Privacy: https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/"
msgstr "當管理員主動使用後台的 Moksa AI 助手時，你輸入的問題以及回答所需的商店／訂單資料（例如訂單編號、狀態、金額或發票／物流號碼）會透過 WordPress 7.0 AI Client，送往你在 WordPress **設定 → 連接器** 連上的 AI 服務商 —— Anthropic、Google 或 OpenAI。這不會自動發生，也只發生在使用助手的那位管理員身上。這個外掛不會把這些對話存放在任何 Moksa 伺服器上，不會傳送任何東西給 Moksa，也絕不會傳送你的 AI 服務商金鑰（連接器憑證由 WordPress 自行管理）。傳送出去的資料適用你所選服務商的服務條款與隱私權政策：Anthropic —— 服務條款：https://www.anthropic.com/legal/commercial-terms —— 隱私權政策：https://www.anthropic.com/legal/privacy ；Google —— 服務條款：https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms —— 隱私權政策：https://policies.google.com/privacy ；OpenAI —— 服務條款：https://openai.com/policies/terms-of-use/ —— 隱私權政策：https://openai.com/policies/privacy-policy/"

#. sub #47
msgid "MCP server (optional, off by default)"
msgstr "MCP 伺服器（選用，預設關閉）"

#. block #48
msgid "This plugin can optionally expose a standards-compliant, stateless MCP (Model Context Protocol) endpoint on **your own site** at `/wp-json/moksa-for-woocommerce/v1/mcp`, so a standard MCP client you control (for example mcp-remote or Claude) can look up orders and reports through the WordPress REST API. This is **not a Moksa service and is not a phone-home**: nothing is sent to Moksa, the endpoint only runs on your server and only exposes the plugin's own WordPress Abilities. It is **off by default** and must be turned on under WooCommerce → Moksa AI → Settings. Access requires authentication with a WordPress Application Password for a user that has the \"edit orders\" capability (use a dedicated, limited account). By default only read-only tools are exposed; order-changing tools stay hidden unless you also enable the separate \"allow external AI to make changes\" option, and every request is permission-checked on your server."
msgstr "這個外掛可以選擇性地在**你自己的網站**上開啟一個符合標準、無狀態的 MCP（Model Context Protocol）端點，位置在 `/wp-json/moksa-for-woocommerce/v1/mcp`，讓你自己掌控的標準 MCP 用戶端（例如 mcp-remote 或 Claude）能夠透過 WordPress REST API 查詢訂單與報表。這**不是 Moksa 的服務，也不是任何形式的回傳**：不會有任何東西送往 Moksa，端點只在你自己的伺服器上運作，而且只暴露這個外掛自己註冊的 WordPress Abilities。它**預設是關閉的**，必須到 WooCommerce → Moksa AI → 設定 裡手動開啟。存取需要以具備「編輯訂單」權限的使用者的 WordPress 應用程式密碼進行驗證（建議另建一個權限受限的專用帳號）。預設只會暴露唯讀工具；除非你另外開啟「允許外部 AI 進行變更」選項，否則會變更訂單的工具都不會出現，而且每一個請求都會在你的伺服器上做權限檢查。"

#. section #49
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安裝"

#. sub #50
msgid "Minimum Requirements"
msgstr "最低需求"

#. li #51
msgid "PHP 8.2+"
msgstr "PHP 8.2 以上"

#. li #52
msgid "WordPress 7.0+"
msgstr "WordPress 7.0 以上"

#. li #53
msgid "WooCommerce 9.9+"
msgstr "WooCommerce 9.9 以上"

#. sub #54
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "設定步驟"

#. ol #55
msgid "Install and activate the plugin."
msgstr "安裝並啟用外掛。"

#. ol #56
msgid "Go to **WooCommerce → Settings → Moksa for WooCommerce** to enable the modules you need."
msgstr "前往 **WooCommerce → 設定 → Moksa for WooCommerce** 啟用你需要的模組。"

#. ol #57
msgid "Configure the credentials for each enabled provider on its dedicated tab."
msgstr "在每個已啟用服務商的專屬分頁上填入該服務商的憑證。"

#. section #58
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "常見問題"

#. sub #59
msgid "Does it work with the Block-based Checkout?"
msgstr "支援區塊結帳嗎？"

#. block #60
msgid "Yes. Every payment method ships an `AbstractPaymentMethodType` + React component, and the convenience-store picker / invoice fields render inside the Checkout block."
msgstr "支援。每一種付款方式都附帶 `AbstractPaymentMethodType` 與 React 元件，超商門市選擇器與發票欄位也都直接在結帳區塊裡呈現。"

#. sub #61
msgid "Is it HPOS-compatible?"
msgstr "相容 HPOS 嗎？"

#. block #62
msgid "Yes. All order meta uses `$order->update_meta_data()` / `$order->save()`, never `update_post_meta()`."
msgstr "相容。所有訂單 meta 一律使用 `$order->update_meta_data()` 與 `$order->save()`，絕不使用 `update_post_meta()`。"

#. sub #63
msgid "Can I mix providers?"
msgstr "可以混用不同服務商嗎？"

#. block #64
msgid "Yes. Payment, shipping and invoice modules are fully independent — any combination works."
msgstr "可以。金流、物流與發票模組彼此完全獨立 —— 任何組合都能運作。"

#. sub #65
msgid "What is the Moksa AI assistant and what does it need?"
msgstr "Moksa AI 助手是什麼？需要什麼條件？"

#. block #66
msgid "It is an optional in-admin chat assistant for managing orders, e-invoices, shipping labels and module settings in natural language. It requires WordPress 7.0 (for the built-in AI Client) and an AI provider connected under **Settings → Connectors**; enable it under the plugin's Advanced settings. Every action that changes data first asks for your confirmation, and the assistant can never read or change your provider credentials, switch sandbox/live mode, or issue refunds."
msgstr "它是一個選用的後台對話助手，讓你用自然語言管理訂單、電子發票、物流標籤與模組設定。它需要 WordPress 7.0（內建 AI Client）以及一個在 **設定 → 連接器** 連上的 AI 服務商；啟用位置在外掛的進階設定。任何會變更資料的動作都會先徵求你的確認，而且助手永遠無法讀取或變更你的服務商憑證、切換測試／正式模式，也不能執行退款。"

#. sub #67
msgid "Can external AI tools connect to my store over MCP?"
msgstr "外部 AI 工具可以透過 MCP 連上我的商店嗎？"

#. block #68
msgid "Yes, optional and off by default. Turn it on under **WooCommerce → Moksa AI → Settings → \"Enable external MCP server\"**. The plugin then serves a standards-compliant, stateless MCP (Model Context Protocol) endpoint at `/wp-json/moksa-for-woocommerce/v1/mcp` that any standard MCP client (for example mcp-remote or Claude) can connect to directly — no bridge required."
msgstr "可以，這是選用功能且預設關閉。開啟位置在 **WooCommerce → Moksa AI → 設定 → 「啟用對外 MCP 伺服器」**。開啟後，外掛會在 `/wp-json/moksa-for-woocommerce/v1/mcp` 提供一個符合標準、無狀態的 MCP（Model Context Protocol）端點，任何標準 MCP 用戶端（例如 mcp-remote 或 Claude）都能直接連上 —— 不需要任何中介橋接。"

#. block #69
msgid "Authentication uses a WordPress Application Password for a user that has the \"edit orders\" capability; use a dedicated, limited account rather than an administrator. Connect your client to the endpoint with an `Authorization: Basic <base64 of username:application-password>` header. By default only read-only tools (look up orders, reports, settings overview) are exposed; order-changing tools stay hidden unless you also enable the \"allow external AI to make changes\" option, and destructive actions still require in-store confirmation. Every request is permission-checked on the server."
msgstr "驗證方式是使用具備「編輯訂單」權限的使用者的 WordPress 應用程式密碼；請另建一個權限受限的專用帳號，不要直接用管理員帳號。用戶端連線時帶上 `Authorization: Basic <base64 of username:application-password>` 標頭即可。預設只會暴露唯讀工具（查訂單、查報表、看設定總覽）；除非你另外開啟「允許外部 AI 進行變更」選項，否則會變更訂單的工具都不會出現，而且破壞性動作仍然需要在商店端確認。每一個請求都會在伺服器上做權限檢查。"

#. section #70
msgid "Screenshots"
msgstr "螢幕截圖"

#. ol #71
msgid "Modules overview — enable only the payment, shipping and e-invoice integrations you need, all from one settings page."
msgstr "模組總覽 —— 只啟用你需要的金流、物流與電子發票整合，全部集中在同一個設定頁面。"

#. ol #72
msgid "Block-based Checkout rendering Taiwanese payment methods natively, alongside the order summary."
msgstr "區塊結帳原生呈現台灣本地的付款方式，與訂單摘要並列。"

#. ol #73
msgid "Order list with the plugin's own order statuses plus shipping-method and tracking-number columns (HPOS-native)."
msgstr "訂單列表，含外掛自訂的訂單狀態，以及運送方式與貨號欄位（原生 HPOS）。"

#. ol #74
msgid "Order edit screen with per-provider payment, shipping and e-invoice cards."
msgstr "訂單編輯頁面，各服務商的金流、物流與電子發票卡片一應俱全。"

#. ol #75
msgid "Issuing an e-invoice from the order screen, including carrier type and mobile barcode entry."
msgstr "從訂單頁面開立電子發票，包含載具類型與手機條碼的輸入。"

#. section #76
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "變更紀錄"

#. sub #77
msgid "1.8.4 - 2026-08-17"
msgstr "1.8.4 - 2026-08-17"

#. li #78
msgid "Fix: after choosing a convenience store, the checkout could still say no store had been picked — and because a store is required to order, the customer was left unable to check out at all. It depended on timing, so it looked intermittent. The chosen store is now recorded while the page is being loaded, before anything else on the checkout can overwrite it."
msgstr "修正：選好超商門市之後，結帳頁仍可能顯示尚未選擇門市；而因為未選門市不能下訂，顧客等於完全無法完成結帳。這個問題取決於時間差，所以看起來時好時壞。現在選定的門市會在頁面載入的當下就記錄下來，早於結帳頁上任何其他動作，不會再被覆蓋。"

#. li #79
msgid "Fix: the A6 label button was missing on 7-ELEVEN bulk and frozen shipments, which do support A6. All the places that decide this now read the same list."
msgstr "修正：7-11 大宗與冷凍的物流單其實支援 A6，訂單頁卻沒有 A6 按鈕。現在所有判斷此事的地方都改讀同一份清單。"

#. li #80
msgid "New: NewebPay pickup orders now show the shipping details to the customer — the tracking number reaches the shipping notification e-mail, the order page shows a shipping card with the pickup store, and there is a link through to the carrier's own tracking page. ECPay, SmilePay and PAYUNi already had all three."
msgstr "新增：藍新超商取貨的訂單現在會把物流資訊呈現給顧客 —— 物流編號會出現在出貨通知信、訂單頁會顯示含取件門市的物流卡片，並提供前往超商官方貨態查詢頁的連結。綠界、速買配與統一金流原本就都有這三項。"

#. li #81
msgid "New: the ECPay shipping settings have a \"Convenience store account type\" option again, so you can choose between the standard (C2C) and bulk (B2C) account. The setting was being read but had no way to change it, which left the bulk credentials unusable."
msgstr "新增：綠界物流設定重新提供「超商帳號類型」選項，可在一般（C2C）與大宗（B2C）帳號之間切換。這個設定原本有被程式讀取，卻沒有任何地方可以變更，導致大宗帳號的憑證填了也用不到。"

#. sub #82
msgid "1.8.3 - 2026-08-17"
msgstr "1.8.3 - 2026-08-17"

#. li #83
msgid "Fix: choosing a convenience store on the classic checkout wiped everything the customer had already typed. Picking a store leaves the site for the carrier's store map and comes back, and the checkout page was rebuilt empty, so name, phone, e-mail and address all had to be entered again. Those details are now carried across and put back automatically. This applies to ECPay, NewebPay and SmilePay pickup, which had no such handling at all; PAYUNi already did, and now shares the same one. The block checkout was never affected."
msgstr "修正：在傳統結帳選擇超商門市時，顧客已經填好的資料會全部消失。選門市會離開網站前往物流業者的門市地圖再回來，而結帳頁是重新載入的空白狀態，於是姓名、電話、電子郵件與地址都得重打一次。現在這些內容會被帶著走並自動填回。綠界、藍新與速買配的超商取貨先前完全沒有這項處理，本次一併補上；統一金流原本就有，現在改用同一份共用實作。區塊結帳不受此問題影響。"

#. sub #84
msgid "1.8.2 - 2026-08-10"
msgstr "1.8.2 - 2026-08-10"

#. li #85
msgid "Fix: when other Moksa plugins are installed alongside this one, a single badly described tool in any of them could make the assistant fail with a \"Bad Request (400)\" before it ran anything — including the order tools in this plugin. The shared assistant now corrects such descriptions on the way to the AI provider, so one plugin can no longer take the whole assistant down."
msgstr "修正：當這個外掛與其他 Moksa 外掛同時安裝時，只要其中任何一個外掛有一項工具的描述寫得不合規，助手就會在還沒開始執行前就以「Bad Request (400)」失敗 —— 連本外掛的訂單工具也一起不能用。共用的助手現在會在送往 AI 服務商的途中修正這類描述，因此單一外掛不再有辦法讓整個助手停擺。"

#. sub #86
msgid "1.8.1 - 2026-08-06"
msgstr "1.8.1 - 2026-08-06"

#. li #87
msgid "Fix: the two buttons on the assistant's confirmation step were labelled \"Confirm\" and \"Cancel\" in English on non-English sites. They now follow the site language."
msgstr "修正：助手確認關卡的兩顆按鈕，在非英文網站上仍顯示英文的「Confirm」與「Cancel」。現在會跟隨網站語言。"

#. li #88
msgid "Fix: translations for text coming from JavaScript were never compiled into the format WordPress loads, so those strings would have stayed in English no matter what the site language was."
msgstr "修正：來自 JavaScript 的文字，其翻譯從未被編譯成 WordPress 實際會載入的格式，因此不論網站語言為何，那些字串都會停留在英文。"

#. li #89
msgid "Fix: PayNow's Chinese name was written two different ways in this readme."
msgstr "修正：立吉富的中文名稱在這份 readme 裡出現了兩種寫法。"

#. li #90
msgid "A full Traditional Chinese translation of this readme is now maintained alongside the plugin translation."
msgstr "這份 readme 現在也維護一份完整的繁體中文翻譯，與外掛本體的翻譯並行。"

#. sub #91
msgid "1.8.0 - 2026-08-06"
msgstr "1.8.0 - 2026-08-06"

#. li #92
msgid "Fix: a customer could place an order with convenience store pickup without ever choosing a store, leaving an order that cannot be shipped. Checkout now stops and asks for the store. This applies to ECPay, NewebPay and SmilePay pickup, on both the block and the classic checkout — previously only PAYUNi pickup was checked."
msgstr "修正：顧客選了超商取貨卻沒有選門市，也能把訂單送出，留下一張根本無法出貨的訂單。現在結帳會擋下來並要求選擇門市。綠界、藍新與速買配的超商取貨，在區塊結帳與傳統結帳都適用 —— 先前只有統一金流的超商取貨會檢查。"

#. li #93
msgid "New: every section on the Advanced tab now has its own \"Enable this section\" switch — shared shipping settings, custom order statuses, order status colors, Taiwan address tools, and Taiwan field order and widths. Switching one off really stops that feature running, rather than only hiding the settings, which is what you want when another plugin is competing for the same part of the checkout. Your settings inside the section are kept, so switching it back on restores everything as it was."
msgstr "新增：進階分頁的每一個區塊現在都有自己的「啟用這個區塊」開關 —— 共用物流設定、自訂訂單狀態、訂單狀態顏色、台灣地址工具，以及台灣欄位順序與寬度。關掉開關是真的讓該功能停止運作，而不是只把設定藏起來；當另一個外掛正在爭搶結帳的同一塊地盤時，你要的就是這個。區塊內的設定會原封不動保留，重新開啟就回到原狀。"

#. sub #94
msgid "1.7.0 - 2026-08-05"
msgstr "1.7.0 - 2026-08-05"

#. li #95
msgid "New: the assistant can change the pickup store on a convenience store order, by store number. It shows you what will change and waits for your confirmation, warns you when a shipment already points at the old store, and never re-books the shipment on its own."
msgstr "新增：助手可以用門市編號變更超商取貨訂單的取件門市。它會先告訴你將要變更的內容並等你確認，若已經有物流單指向舊門市也會提醒你，而且絕不會自作主張重新建立物流單。"

#. li #96
msgid "New: the assistant can list the shipments on an order and delete one, so a shipment can be created again — for example after the pickup store was changed. Deleting only removes the record on this site; it does not cancel the booking with the carrier."
msgstr "新增：助手可以列出訂單上的物流單並刪除其中一筆，讓物流單能重新建立 —— 例如在變更取件門市之後。刪除只會移除本站上的紀錄，不會向物流業者取消該筆委託。"

#. li #97
msgid "New: the assistant can look a payment up at the provider (ECPay card payments and PAYUNi) for when the order and the provider disagree, such as a customer saying they paid while the order still shows unpaid."
msgstr "新增：助手可以直接向服務商查詢款項狀態（綠界信用卡與統一金流），適合用在訂單與服務商說法不一致的時候，例如顧客說已經付款、但訂單仍顯示未付款。"

#. li #98
msgid "New for MCP clients: the store now also offers resources (what the store has switched on, the shipping methods on offer, sales over the last 30 days) and ready-made prompts (daily shipping run, checking payments against the provider, finding orders missing an e-invoice, moving an order to another store)."
msgstr "MCP 用戶端新增：商店現在也提供資源（商店啟用了哪些功能、提供哪些運送方式、近 30 天的銷售）與現成的提示詞（每日出貨作業、與服務商對帳、找出漏開電子發票的訂單、把訂單改到另一家門市）。"

#. li #99
msgid "Fix: on the order screen, the two buttons in the PAYUNi shipping card were touching each other with no space between them."
msgstr "修正：訂單頁面上，統一金流物流卡片裡的兩顆按鈕緊貼在一起，中間完全沒有留白。"

#. sub #100
msgid "1.6.3 - 2026-08-05"
msgstr "1.6.3 - 2026-08-05"

#. li #101
msgid "Fix: creating an ECPay shipment failed with \"商品名稱請設定為最多50字元\" (10500038) on orders whose product names are in Chinese. ECPay counts a Chinese character as two, but the item name was being trimmed by character count, so a 50-character Chinese name reached ECPay as 100. It is now trimmed the same way ECPay measures it, and English names can still use the full 50 characters."
msgstr "修正：商品名稱是中文的訂單，建立綠界物流單時會失敗並顯示「商品名稱請設定為最多50字元」（10500038）。綠界把一個中文字算成兩個字元，但商品名稱是照字元數截斷的，於是 50 個中文字送到綠界那邊變成 100。現在改成用綠界的計算方式截斷，英文名稱仍然可以用滿 50 個字元。"

#. li #102
msgid "Fix: characters ECPay rejects are now replaced with a space instead of being deleted, so several product names no longer run together on the label."
msgstr "修正：綠界不接受的字元現在會替換成空白，而不是直接刪掉，這樣標籤上好幾個商品名稱才不會黏成一團。"

#. li #103
msgid "The same character-count trimming was applied to the PAYUNi and SmilePay shipment descriptions as a precaution."
msgstr "同樣的字元寬度截斷方式也套用到統一金流與速買配的物流品名，作為預防。"

#. sub #104
msgid "1.6.2 - 2026-08-05"
msgstr "1.6.2 - 2026-08-05"

#. li #105
msgid "Tested against WooCommerce 11.0."
msgstr "已在 WooCommerce 11.0 上完成測試。"

#. li #106
msgid "Fix: the store picker layout setting showed \"one column\" as selected on stores that had never saved it, while the checkout actually rendered two columns. The two now agree."
msgstr "修正：從未儲存過門市選擇器版面設定的商店，設定畫面顯示的是「單欄」，但結帳實際上是用雙欄呈現。現在兩邊一致了。"

#. sub #107
msgid "1.6.1 - 2026-08-05"
msgstr "1.6.1 - 2026-08-05"

#. li #108
msgid "Fix: switching an order to (or away from) a convenience-store method in the items panel now updates the store fields straight away. They used to appear only after saving the order and reloading the page, which made it look like you could not pick a store on an order you created in the admin yourself."
msgstr "修正：在訂單項目面板把運送方式改成（或改離）超商取貨方式時，門市欄位現在會立刻更新。以前必須先儲存訂單並重新載入頁面才會出現，讓人以為自己在後台建立的訂單根本沒辦法選門市。"

#. li #109
msgid "Fix: the convenience-store card on the classic checkout was squashed into a narrow strip on phones. The card is now given the full width of the order summary, with the label on its own line."
msgstr "修正：傳統結帳的超商門市卡片在手機上被擠成一條細長條。現在卡片會佔滿訂單摘要的寬度，標籤也獨立成一行。"

#. sub #110
msgid "1.6.0 - 2026-08-04"
msgstr "1.6.0 - 2026-08-04"

#. li #111
msgid "New: change the pickup store on a convenience-store order from the order screen. Open the shipping address for editing and you get store number, store name and store address fields, plus a \"Choose store on map\" button that opens the carrier's own store map in a new window and fills the fields in when you pick a store. Works for ECPay, NewebPay, PAYUNi and SmilePay pickup methods, and on orders you create in the admin yourself."
msgstr "新增：可以從訂單頁面變更超商取貨訂單的取件門市。把收件地址切換到編輯狀態，就會出現門市編號、門市名稱與門市地址欄位，以及一顆「用地圖選門市」按鈕 —— 它會在新視窗開啟該物流業者自己的門市地圖，選好門市後自動把欄位填回來。綠界、藍新、統一金流與速買配的超商取貨方式都適用，你自己在後台建立的訂單也適用。"

#. li #112
msgid "New: changing the store leaves an order note recording the old and new store number, as a reminder that a shipment created earlier still points at the old store."
msgstr "新增：變更門市時會留下一筆訂單備註，記錄新舊門市編號，提醒你先前建立的物流單仍然指向舊門市。"

#. li #113
msgid "Removed an admin store-map callback endpoint in the PAYUNi shipping module that nothing linked to and that no longer worked on HPOS sites."
msgstr "移除了統一金流物流模組裡一個後台門市地圖回呼端點 —— 沒有任何地方連到它，而且在 HPOS 網站上早已無法運作。"

#. sub #114
msgid "1.5.4 - 2026-08-01"
msgstr "1.5.4 - 2026-08-01"

#. li #115
msgid "Fix: saving the module list switched off any module whose card is not on that screen. Order number lookup is configured on the Advanced tab, so every save silently turned it off — and because it is what registers the assistant's tools, the AI assistant was left with nothing to work with."
msgstr "修正：儲存模組清單時，會把所有卡片不在該畫面上的模組一併關閉。訂單查號設定在進階分頁上，所以每存一次就被靜靜關掉一次 —— 而它正是註冊助手工具的地方，於是 AI 助手就變成無事可做。"

#. li #116
msgid "Fix: enabling only the AI assistant gave it no tools at all, so the chat window never appeared and nothing seemed to happen. It now registers the order abilities it needs on its own."
msgstr "修正：只啟用 AI 助手時，它一個工具都拿不到，對話窗因此從未出現，看起來就像什麼事都沒發生。現在它會自行註冊所需的訂單能力。"

#. li #117
msgid "Fix: opening the Moksa AI screen while both modules were off showed \"you do not have permission to access this page\", which is what WordPress says about a page that is not registered — it was never a permissions problem. The screen now explains the situation and links to the module list."
msgstr "修正：兩個模組都關閉時開啟 Moksa AI 畫面，會顯示「你沒有權限存取此頁面」—— 那是 WordPress 對一個未註冊頁面的固定說法，從來就不是權限問題。現在這個畫面會說明狀況，並提供前往模組清單的連結。"

#. li #118
msgid "Fix: the checkout field order list was missing the email field."
msgstr "修正：結帳欄位順序清單漏了電子郵件欄位。"

#. sub #119
msgid "1.5.3 - 2026-08-01"
msgstr "1.5.3 - 2026-08-01"

#. li #120
msgid "Fix: 1.5.2 could show a floating assistant button on every admin screen even when nothing was available to run, opening an empty panel. It now appears only when there is something to show."
msgstr "修正：1.5.2 可能在每一個後台畫面都顯示浮動助手按鈕，即使根本沒有任何可執行的東西，點開只是一個空面板。現在只有真的有內容可顯示時才會出現。"

#. li #121
msgid "Fix: the assistant button used an emoji, which WordPress replaces with an image hosted on s.w.org; on sites that cannot reach that host it rendered as a broken image. It is now drawn as an inline icon and loads nothing external."
msgstr "修正：助手按鈕使用了 emoji，而 WordPress 會把 emoji 換成 s.w.org 上的圖片；連不到該主機的網站就會看到破圖。現在改用內嵌圖示繪製，不載入任何外部資源。"

#. li #122
msgid "Fix: the fallback panel shown when no AI provider is configured was untranslated. Its labels now follow the site language."
msgstr "修正：尚未設定 AI 服務商時顯示的備援面板沒有翻譯。它的文字現在會跟隨網站語言。"

#. sub #123
msgid "1.5.2 - 2026-08-01"
msgstr "1.5.2 - 2026-08-01"

#. li #124
msgid "The Moksa AI chat window is now a shared component. When several Moksa plugins are installed alongside each other they no longer each draw their own floating window; one window serves them all and can reach every plugin's abilities. Installed on its own, this plugin behaves exactly as before."
msgstr "Moksa AI 對話窗改成共用元件。當多個 Moksa 外掛同時安裝時，它們不再各自畫一個浮動視窗；一個視窗服務全部，並且能使用每個外掛的能力。單獨安裝這個外掛時，行為與先前完全相同。"

#. li #125
msgid "Fix: the assistant advertised its 28 abilities to the AI model even when the module that actually registers them was switched off. A model given a tool name that does not exist does not report an error — it invents an answer that looks plausible. Only abilities that are genuinely registered are offered now."
msgstr "修正：即使真正註冊能力的模組是關閉的，助手仍然向 AI 模型宣告它有那 28 項能力。模型拿到一個不存在的工具名稱不會回報錯誤 —— 它會編出一個看起來很合理的答案。現在只會提供真正註冊成功的能力。"

#. sub #126
msgid "1.5.1 - 2026-08-01"
msgstr "1.5.1 - 2026-08-01"

#. li #127
msgid "Fix: the \"About Moksa AI\" status badge used emoji, which WordPress replaces with an image hosted on s.w.org. On sites where that host is unreachable the badge rendered as a broken image. It is now drawn in CSS and loads nothing external."
msgstr "修正：「關於 Moksa AI」狀態徽章使用了 emoji，而 WordPress 會把 emoji 換成 s.w.org 上的圖片。在連不到該主機的網站上，徽章就會變成破圖。現在改用 CSS 繪製，不載入任何外部資源。"

#. li #128
msgid "Fix: the Moksa AI submenu appeared under WooCommerce whether or not the assistant was in use. It now appears only once the Moksa AI or Storefront support module is enabled."
msgstr "修正：不管有沒有在用助手，Moksa AI 子選單都會出現在 WooCommerce 底下。現在只有啟用 Moksa AI 或前台客服模組之後才會出現。"

#. li #129
msgid "Fix: those two modules had no card on the module overview, so there was no way to enable them from the settings tab at all. They now appear under Tools alongside every other module."
msgstr "修正：這兩個模組在模組總覽上沒有卡片，因此根本無法從設定分頁啟用它們。現在它們會和其他模組一樣列在「工具」分類下。"

#. li #130
msgid "Fix: both modules were behind two separate switches — the module card and a second master switch inside the Moksa AI screen — so enabling one alone did nothing. The module card is now the only switch. Sites that had the old master switch off keep both modules off."
msgstr "修正：這兩個模組原本被兩道開關擋著 —— 模組卡片，以及 Moksa AI 畫面裡的第二道總開關 —— 所以只開其中一道毫無作用。現在模組卡片是唯一的開關。原本總開關是關閉狀態的網站，兩個模組維持關閉。"

#. li #131
msgid "The Moksa AI screen now uses the same collapsible section cards as the rest of the settings tab."
msgstr "Moksa AI 畫面現在改用與設定分頁其他地方相同的可收合區塊卡片。"

#. sub #132
msgid "1.5.0 - 2026-08-01"
msgstr "1.5.0 - 2026-08-01"

#. li #133
msgid "i18n: every translatable string is now written in English in the source, and Traditional Chinese ships as a real translation. Previously the source strings were Chinese, which meant the plugin could never be translated into any other language and WordPress.org reported it as having no Traditional Chinese localisation at all. 2,442 strings are covered, so Chinese stores see exactly the same wording as before."
msgstr "i18n：所有可翻譯字串的原始文字現在一律以英文撰寫，繁體中文則以真正的翻譯形式隨附。先前原始字串是中文，這代表這個外掛永遠無法被翻譯成其他語言，而且 WordPress.org 會判定它完全沒有繁體中文在地化。這次涵蓋 2,442 條字串，因此中文商店看到的用字與先前完全相同。"

#. li #134
msgid "i18n: Taiwanese cities and districts now use a translator context (`_x`), so the districts that share a name across cities — Zhongzheng in both Taipei and Keelung, for example — are no longer collapsed into one entry that translators cannot tell apart."
msgstr "i18n：台灣縣市與鄉鎮區現在帶有譯者情境（`_x`），因此跨縣市同名的行政區 —— 例如台北與基隆都有的中正區 —— 不會再被併成同一條、讓譯者無從分辨。"

#. li #135
msgid "Fix: invoice line-item units sent to the e-invoice services were wrapped in a translation call, so on a non-Chinese site they would have been submitted in the site language instead of the value the tax authority expects. They are now sent as fixed data."
msgstr "修正：送往電子發票服務的品項單位先前被包在翻譯函式裡，所以在非中文網站上，送出去的會是網站語言而不是稅務機關要求的值。現在改以固定資料送出。"

#. li #136
msgid "Fix: the order-status labels shown as post-status counts in the admin order list are now translatable in their own right rather than reusing an unrelated shipment-tracking string."
msgstr "修正：後台訂單列表中作為文章狀態計數顯示的訂單狀態標籤，現在有自己獨立的可翻譯字串，不再沿用一條無關的物流貨態字串。"

#. li #137
msgid "Dev: the translation catalogue is generated from a single English-to-Chinese map and the build fails if any string is missing a translation, so a new string can no longer ship untranslated."
msgstr "開發：翻譯目錄由單一份英中對照表產生，只要有任何字串缺少翻譯，建置就會失敗，因此新字串再也不可能未翻譯就出貨。"

#. sub #138
msgid "1.4.9 - 2026-07-26"
msgstr "1.4.9 - 2026-07-26"

#. li #139
msgid "Security: two SmilePay logistics endpoints (T-cat tracking-number retrieval and C2B label data) were still declared with plain http://; both now use https:// (verified reachable), so every request the plugin makes is TLS-encrypted as the readme states."
msgstr "安全性：速買配物流的兩個端點（黑貓貨號取得與 C2B 標籤資料）先前仍以純 http:// 宣告；兩者現在都改用 https://（已驗證可連線），因此外掛發出的每一個請求都如 readme 所述經過 TLS 加密。"

#. li #140
msgid "Security: the module on/off save handler and the order-status colour save handler verified neither a nonce nor a capability inside the method, relying on the WooCommerce settings page upstream. Both now verify the WooCommerce settings nonce and the manage_woocommerce capability inline, in the same form WooCommerce core uses."
msgstr "安全性：模組開關儲存處理程序與訂單狀態顏色儲存處理程序，在方法內部既沒有驗證 nonce 也沒有檢查權限，而是仰賴上游的 WooCommerce 設定頁。現在兩者都以 WooCommerce 核心相同的形式，就地驗證 WooCommerce 設定 nonce 與 manage_woocommerce 權限。"

#. li #141
msgid "Security: the quick-edit and bulk-edit handlers for the product temperature-zone field verified a nonce name that WooCommerce never issues for those forms, so the check always failed and the field silently stopped saving from quick/bulk edit. They now verify the same woocommerce_quick_edit_nonce that WooCommerce core verifies, restoring the feature."
msgstr "安全性：商品溫層欄位的快速編輯與批次編輯處理程序，驗證的是一個 WooCommerce 在那些表單上從不發放的 nonce 名稱，因此檢查永遠失敗，該欄位也就無聲無息地無法從快速／批次編輯儲存。現在改為驗證 WooCommerce 核心實際驗證的 woocommerce_quick_edit_nonce，功能已恢復。"

#. li #142
msgid "Security: the classic-checkout store validation and the PAYUNi store-restore handler now verify their nonces first, in straight-line form, before touching any request field."
msgstr "安全性：傳統結帳的門市驗證與統一金流的門市還原處理程序，現在都以直線式寫法先驗證 nonce，才碰任何請求欄位。"

#. li #143
msgid "readme: every provider entry now lists its test/sandbox hostname inline and carries an explicit Terms link and an explicit Privacy link (providers publishing a single combined document have both links pointing at it, with a note); the AMEGO terms link points at the actual terms page; added the previously undocumented ecpayment-stage.ecpay.com.tw test hostname."
msgstr "readme：每一個服務商條目現在都直接列出其測試／沙箱主機名稱，並附上明確的服務條款連結與明確的隱私權政策連結（服務商若只發佈單一份合併文件，兩個連結會指向同一份並加註說明）；AMEGO 的條款連結改指向真正的條款頁；補上先前未記載的 ecpayment-stage.ecpay.com.tw 測試主機。"

#. sub #144
msgid "1.4.8 - 2026-07-19"
msgstr "1.4.8 - 2026-07-19"

#. li #145
msgid "i18n: the text domain is now `moksa-for-woocommerce`, matching the assigned plugin slug (all 4,000+ gettext calls, the plugin header, the block-checkout scripts and the bundled zh_TW translation files were updated; the main plugin file was renamed accordingly)."
msgstr "i18n：文字網域改為 `moksa-for-woocommerce`，與核配的外掛代稱一致（全部 4,000 多個 gettext 呼叫、外掛標頭、區塊結帳腳本與隨附的 zh_TW 翻譯檔都已更新；外掛主檔亦隨之更名）。"

#. li #146
msgid "Security: the PChomePay webhook no longer trusts its payload at all. On top of the source-IP allowlist, every notification now triggers a server-to-server query back to PChomePay (`GET /v1/payment/{id}`) and the authoritative API response gates the order transition: `order_confirm` requires API status S with a matching amount, and expiry/failure notifications are rejected for orders the API reports as paid. The allowlisted IPs are now filterable via `moksafowo_pchomepay_notify_ips`."
msgstr "安全性：支付連 webhook 不再信任其內容。除了來源 IP 白名單之外，每一筆通知現在都會觸發一次回查支付連的伺服器對伺服器請求（`GET /v1/payment/{id}`），並以 API 的權威回應決定訂單是否轉換狀態：`order_confirm` 必須 API 狀態為 S 且金額相符，而 API 回報為已付款的訂單則會拒絕過期／失敗通知。白名單 IP 現在可透過 `moksafowo_pchomepay_notify_ips` 過濾。"

#. li #147
msgid "Security: the product temperature quick-edit / bulk-edit / product-save / variation-save handlers now re-verify the WooCommerce nonce and check `edit_product` capability in-place (fail-closed) instead of relying on the upstream caller having done so."
msgstr "安全性：商品溫層的快速編輯／批次編輯／商品儲存／變體儲存處理程序，現在都會就地重新驗證 WooCommerce nonce 並檢查 `edit_product` 權限（失敗即拒絕），而不是仰賴上游呼叫端已經做過。"

#. li #148
msgid "readme: each SmilePay integration now explains that ssl.smse.com.tw is SmilePay's own API hostname (smse.com.tw and smilepay.net are operated by the same company, 訊航科技); OpenAI policy links point at the individual terms and privacy pages."
msgstr "readme：每一個速買配整合現在都會說明 ssl.smse.com.tw 是速買配自己的 API 主機名稱（smse.com.tw 與 smilepay.net 由同一家公司訊航科技營運）；OpenAI 的政策連結改指向個別的條款與隱私權頁面。"

#. sub #149
msgid "1.4.7 - 2026-07-12"
msgstr "1.4.7 - 2026-07-12"

#. li #150
msgid "Naming: the PHP namespace root was changed from `MoksaWeb\\Mowc\\` to `Moksafowo\\`, so every global identifier the plugin declares (namespaces, constants, options, hooks, AJAX actions, database tables) now shares the single `moksafowo` prefix."
msgstr "命名：PHP 命名空間根目錄由 `MoksaWeb\\Mowc\\` 改為 `Moksafowo\\`，因此外掛宣告的每一個全域識別字（命名空間、常數、選項、掛鉤、AJAX action、資料表）現在共用單一的 `moksafowo` 前綴。"

#. li #151
msgid "Naming: six filters were still published under WooCommerce-prefixed hook names (`woocommerce_get_sections_*`, `woocommerce_get_settings_*`, `woocommerce_shipping_*_is_available`) even though the methods that fire them fully override WooCommerce and never call the parent implementation. They are now `moksafowo_*`."
msgstr "命名：有六個過濾器仍以 WooCommerce 前綴的掛鉤名稱發佈（`woocommerce_get_sections_*`、`woocommerce_get_settings_*`、`woocommerce_shipping_*_is_available`），儘管觸發它們的方法完全覆寫了 WooCommerce、從不呼叫父類實作。現在一律改為 `moksafowo_*`。"

#. li #152
msgid "Naming: the checkout field namespace and admin CSS class prefix were unified under `moksafowo`; the unused legacy `MOWP_VAULT_KEY` constant fallback was removed."
msgstr "命名：結帳欄位命名空間與後台 CSS 類別前綴統一收斂到 `moksafowo`；未使用的舊 `MOWP_VAULT_KEY` 常數備援已移除。"

#. li #153
msgid "Database: every table name now goes through `$wpdb->prepare()` using the `%i` identifier placeholder, and every `LIKE` pattern through `%s`. No table name or search term is interpolated into SQL anywhere in the plugin, including `uninstall.php`."
msgstr "資料庫：每一個資料表名稱現在都透過 `$wpdb->prepare()` 搭配 `%i` 識別字佔位符處理，每一個 `LIKE` 樣式則透過 `%s`。外掛裡任何地方都不再把資料表名稱或搜尋字串直接串進 SQL，`uninstall.php` 也一樣。"

#. li #154
msgid "Fix: `Aes::decrypt_cbc_hex()` validated its input only after calling `hex2bin()`, which emitted a PHP warning on malformed input before the exception was thrown. It now validates first."
msgstr "修正：`Aes::decrypt_cbc_hex()` 先呼叫 `hex2bin()` 才驗證輸入，導致格式錯誤的輸入會在丟出例外之前先發出一則 PHP warning。現在改為先驗證。"

#. li #155
msgid "Admin: order detail notes no longer expose the internal plugin codename."
msgstr "後台：訂單詳情備註不再洩漏外掛的內部代號。"

#. sub #156
msgid "1.4.6 - 2026-07-12"
msgstr "1.4.6 - 2026-07-12"

#. li #157
msgid "Security fix: the NewebPay logistics store-map callback verified its signature only when a HashData value was actually supplied, so an attacker could omit it to skip verification. Now rejected (fail-closed) whenever HashData is missing."
msgstr "安全性修正：藍新物流的門市地圖回呼，只有在實際帶了 HashData 值時才驗證簽章，攻擊者只要省略它就能跳過驗證。現在只要缺少 HashData 一律拒絕（失敗即拒絕）。"

#. li #158
msgid "Security fix: PayNow's secondary PassCode2 check (barcode/e-wallet payments) was skipped when the field was empty instead of being required; now fail-closed."
msgstr "安全性修正：立吉富的第二道 PassCode2 檢查（超商條碼／電子錢包付款）在該欄位為空時是跳過而非要求，現在改為失敗即拒絕。"

#. li #159
msgid "Settings: corrected the SmilePay \"Mid\" field description, which still described the old skip-if-empty behaviour after the fail-closed fix."
msgstr "設定：修正速買配「Mid」欄位的說明文字 —— 在改為失敗即拒絕之後，它仍在描述舊的「空值就跳過」行為。"

#. li #160
msgid "readme: OpenAI's Terms/Privacy links replaced with OpenAI's policy hub, which several individual policy sub-pages intermittently blocked as bot traffic."
msgstr "readme：OpenAI 的條款／隱私權連結改為指向 OpenAI 的政策總覽頁，因為好幾個個別政策子頁會不定時把存取判定為機器人流量而擋下。"

#. li #161
msgid "Added explicit references to the exact WooCommerce core methods (`WC_Settings_Page`, `WC_Shipping_Method::is_available()`) that mandate the `woocommerce_*`-prefixed filter tag names flagged by the automated prefix scan — these are WooCommerce's own extension-point names, not ones this plugin defines."
msgstr "補上明確的說明，指出自動化前綴掃描標記的那些 `woocommerce_*` 前綴過濾器標籤名稱，是由哪些 WooCommerce 核心方法（`WC_Settings_Page`、`WC_Shipping_Method::is_available()`）所規定 —— 那是 WooCommerce 自己的擴充點名稱，不是這個外掛定義的。"

#. sub #162
msgid "1.4.5 - 2026-07-12"
msgstr "1.4.5 - 2026-07-12"

#. li #163
msgid "Security hardening: the SmilePay payment callback now rejects requests when the merchant verification code (參數碼) is not configured (fail-closed) and only accepts callbacks for orders actually paid via SmilePay."
msgstr "安全性強化：速買配的付款回呼現在會在商家驗證參數碼未設定時拒絕請求（失敗即拒絕），而且只接受確實透過速買配付款的訂單的回呼。"

#. li #164
msgid "The LINE Pay admin confirm action now uses the standard check_ajax_referer() flow."
msgstr "LINE Pay 後台的確認動作現在改用標準的 check_ajax_referer() 流程。"

#. li #165
msgid "Readme: clarified SmilePay/ezPay combined terms & privacy documents and documented carrier tracking links (pure hyperlinks — the plugin never contacts those hosts) with verified policy links."
msgstr "readme：釐清速買配／ezPay 的服務條款與隱私權合併文件，並記載了貨態查詢連結（純超連結 —— 外掛從不連線那些主機）與已驗證的政策連結。"

#. sub #166
msgid "1.4.4 - 2026-07-05"
msgstr "1.4.4 - 2026-07-05"

#. li #167
msgid "Removed a non-functional leftover PAYUNi credentials migrator (its map used identical source and target option names, so it did nothing)."
msgstr "移除了一個沒有作用的統一金流憑證遷移程式殘留（它的對應表來源與目標選項名稱相同，等於什麼都沒做）。"

#. li #168
msgid "The e-invoice donation-organization option is now written under a statically-prefixed, allow-listed option name."
msgstr "電子發票的捐贈機構選項現在改以靜態前綴、列入白名單的選項名稱寫入。"

#. li #169
msgid "Reworked the PAYUNi store-selection restore so the nonce verification is inline and explicit."
msgstr "重寫統一金流的門市選擇還原流程，讓 nonce 驗證改為就地且明確。"

#. sub #170
msgid "1.4.3 - 2026-06-28"
msgstr "1.4.3 - 2026-06-28"

#. li #171
msgid "Completed the \"External services\" documentation in the readme to list every payment, shipping and e-invoice endpoint the plugin can contact, including the credit-card query endpoint and all sandbox/test hostnames."
msgstr "補完 readme 的「外部服務」說明，列出外掛可能連線的每一個金流、物流與電子發票端點，包含信用卡查詢端點與所有沙箱／測試主機名稱。"

#. li #172
msgid "Minor security hardening of the PAYUNi store-selection AJAX handler: the request nonce is now verified before any other processing."
msgstr "統一金流門市選擇 AJAX 處理程序的次要安全性強化：請求的 nonce 現在會在任何其他處理之前先驗證。"

#. sub #173
msgid "1.4.2 - 2026-06-21"
msgstr "1.4.2 - 2026-06-21"

#. li #174
msgid "Improved the AI assistant's handling of multi-part questions (e.g. asking for revenue and pending-shipment counts in one message) so they are answered reliably in a single reply."
msgstr "改善 AI 助手處理多重問題的方式（例如在同一則訊息裡同時問營業額與待出貨筆數），讓它能可靠地在單一回覆中一併回答。"

#. sub #175
msgid "1.4.1 - 2026-06-20"
msgstr "1.4.1 - 2026-06-20"

#. li #176
msgid "Further hardened output escaping on the admin order payment panel and the customer payment-information notice and email (allow-listed HTML at the point of output)."
msgstr "進一步強化後台訂單金流面板、顧客付款資訊通知與電子郵件的輸出跳脫（在輸出當下以白名單方式處理 HTML）。"

#. sub #177
msgid "1.4.0 - 2026-06-20"
msgstr "1.4.0 - 2026-06-20"

#. li #178
msgid "E-invoice fields on the block checkout now show, hide and validate through WooCommerce's native conditional field logic (JSON Schema) instead of custom scripting, for reliable behaviour across WooCommerce updates."
msgstr "區塊結帳上的電子發票欄位，現在改用 WooCommerce 原生的條件式欄位邏輯（JSON Schema）來顯示、隱藏與驗證，不再依賴自訂腳本，行為在 WooCommerce 更新之後依然可靠。"

#. li #179
msgid "The mobile-barcode and personal-certificate carrier inputs are now separate fields, each with its own format validation."
msgstr "手機條碼與自然人憑證載具的輸入現在拆成各自獨立的欄位，各有自己的格式驗證。"

#. li #180
msgid "Raised the minimum WooCommerce version to 9.9, required by the native conditional checkout fields."
msgstr "將 WooCommerce 最低版本提高到 9.9，這是原生條件式結帳欄位所需要的。"

#. li #181
msgid "Internal consolidation of the e-invoice checkout-field code, plus further hardening of asset loading and input handling."
msgstr "電子發票結帳欄位程式碼的內部整併，並進一步強化資源載入與輸入處理。"

#. sub #182
msgid "1.3.0 - 2026-06-18"
msgstr "1.3.0 - 2026-06-18"

#. li #183
msgid "New Moksa AI in-admin assistant (requires WordPress 7.0 AI Client and a configured AI connector): query and manage orders, e-invoices, shipping labels and module settings in natural language, with a human confirmation step before any change is applied."
msgstr "全新的 Moksa AI 後台助手（需要 WordPress 7.0 AI Client 與已設定的 AI 連接器）：用自然語言查詢與管理訂單、電子發票、物流標籤與模組設定，任何變更套用之前都有一道人工確認關卡。"

#. li #184
msgid "Order tools via the WordPress Abilities API: find order by number, order details, order counts, status changes (single and batch), order notes, and an advanced order list."
msgstr "透過 WordPress Abilities API 提供的訂單工具：以編號查訂單、訂單明細、訂單筆數、狀態變更（單筆與批次）、訂單備註，以及進階訂單清單。"

#. li #185
msgid "Taiwan e-invoice actions: issue, void and allowance, plus per-channel issuing-method toggles."
msgstr "台灣電子發票動作：開立、作廢與折讓，另有各通路的開立方式開關。"

#. li #186
msgid "Shipping: create a logistics booking and print labels (single and batch)."
msgstr "物流：建立物流委託單與列印標籤（單筆與批次）。"

#. li #187
msgid "Manage settings by natural language: enable or disable provider modules, individual payment methods and invoice issuing methods — each behind a confirmation step. Credentials and sandbox/live switches are never exposed."
msgstr "用自然語言管理設定：啟用或停用服務商模組、個別付款方式與發票開立方式 —— 每一項都有確認關卡。憑證與測試／正式模式切換永遠不會被暴露。"

#. li #188
msgid "Raised the minimum WordPress version to 7.0, required by the AI assistant and the Abilities API. Core payment, shipping and invoice features are unchanged."
msgstr "將 WordPress 最低版本提高到 7.0，這是 AI 助手與 Abilities API 所需要的。核心的金流、物流與發票功能不受影響。"

#. li #189
msgid "Removed the unused SMS module."
msgstr "移除未使用的簡訊模組。"

#. sub #190
msgid "1.1.0 - 2026-06-05"
msgstr "1.1.0 - 2026-06-05"

#. li #191
msgid "All global identifiers renamed to the unique `moksafowo` prefix (options, hooks, AJAX actions, gateway IDs, script handles, order meta, custom order statuses) per WordPress.org review."
msgstr "依 WordPress.org 審查要求，所有全域識別字改用獨一無二的 `moksafowo` 前綴（選項、掛鉤、AJAX action、金流 ID、腳本 handle、訂單 meta、自訂訂單狀態）。"

#. li #192
msgid "Hardened all payment / logistics webhook handlers: signature verification before any use, full per-field input sanitization, no raw request logging."
msgstr "強化所有金流／物流 webhook 處理程序：任何使用之前先驗證簽章、每個欄位完整清理輸入、不記錄原始請求內容。"

#. li #193
msgid "Store-selection restore at checkout now requires a nonce."
msgstr "結帳時的門市選擇還原現在需要 nonce。"

#. li #194
msgid "All inline `<script>` / `<style>` output replaced with `wp_enqueue_*`, `wp_add_inline_*` and `wp_print_inline_script_tag()`."
msgstr "所有行內 `<script>` ／ `<style>` 輸出改用 `wp_enqueue_*`、`wp_add_inline_*` 與 `wp_print_inline_script_tag()`。"

#. li #195
msgid "All dynamic admin card / tracking-link HTML now escaped through explicit `wp_kses` allowlists at output time."
msgstr "所有動態產生的後台卡片／貨態連結 HTML，現在都在輸出當下透過明確的 `wp_kses` 白名單跳脫。"

#. sub #196
msgid "1.0.0 - 2026-05-26"
msgstr "1.0.0 - 2026-05-26"

#. li #197
msgid "Initial public release on the WordPress.org Plugin Directory."
msgstr "在 WordPress.org 外掛目錄首次公開發佈。"

#. section #198
msgid "Upgrade Notice"
msgstr "升級說明"

#. sub #199
msgid "1.0.0"
msgstr "1.0.0"

#. block #200
msgid "Initial public release."
msgstr "首次公開發佈。"
